This test only verifies that TagsCommand overrides the default GitHub release lookup.
The intentionally minimal binary config is not a complete ebuild fixture and therefore
does not exercise manifest generation.

-- input.config --
Type Github Binary Release
GithubProjectUrl https://github.com/JetBrains/junie
TagsCommand curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JetBrains/junie/main/update-info.jsonl | jq -r '.version' | sort -u -V -r
Category dev-util
EbuildName junie-bin
ProgramName junie

-- expected.yaml --
          tags=$(curl -s https://raw.githubusercontent.com/JetBrains/junie/main/update-info.jsonl | jq -r '.version' | sort -u -V -r)
